  aciklama:
  - "\"Kanatlar\u0131n varsa, toza, bal\xE7\u0131\u011Fa bulanmamal\u0131s\u0131n.
    Kanat dedi\u011Fin havaya kar\u0131\u015Fmal\u0131 ki seni g\xF6klere, y\xFCcelere
    al\u0131p g\xF6t\xFCrs\xFCn. D\xFCnya, 'a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131' demektir. Kanatlar\u0131
    olana a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131ya raz\u0131 olmak d\xFC\u015Fmez. Cennetin semas\u0131ndan
    kalbinin kanatlar\u0131n\u0131 sonsuzluk a\u015Fk\u0131yla a\xE7mak istiyorsan,
    a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131dayken 'a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131l\u0131k' i\u015Flere giri\u015Fme.
    Kalbinin kanatlar\u0131n\u0131 alabildi\u011Fine a\xE7maya ne yer var burada
    ne g\xF6k. \u015Eimdilik a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131das\u0131n; hep a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131larda
    kalmaya heveslenme...\""
